{"blocks":[{"paragraph":{"format":{"heading":1,"spaceAfterPt":6},"id":"dc4eaa66-3111-4dcd-b4c4-36c0794f4ec6","mark":0,"spans":[[40,0]],"text":"Field report: mixed scripts across pages"}},{"paragraph":{"format":{"lineHeight":1.2,"spaceAfterPt":8},"id":"e9602356-290f-467b-a325-441f4525992b","mark":0,"spans":[[9,1],[34,0],[19,2],[175,0],[13,3],[13,0]],"text":"This page mixes scripts in one flow: English, עברית (Hebrew), العربية (Arabic), हिन्दी (Devanagari), 中文排版 and 日本語, emoji 👩‍👩‍👧 🇺🇸 and combining marks (é). Selection, caret movement and search keep grapheme clusters whole. Read the specification for details."}},{"paragraph":{"format":{"lineHeight":1.2,"spaceAfterPt":8},"id":"232122dd-8f5b-4161-b95b-8c4b265db6f8","mark":0,"spans":[[39,0],[1,4],[48,0]],"text":"An inline object sits on the baseline: ￼ and text continues after it, wrapping as usual."}},{"paragraph":{"format":{"lineHeight":1.2,"list":"0f02f8a5-cb56-4530-a504-f7c590c8b63b","spaceAfterPt":8},"id":"4bc04813-b2dd-42de-b778-53155e360a15","mark":0,"spans":[[30,0]],"text":"Bulleted item with שלום inside"}},{"paragraph":{"format":{"lineHeight":1.2,"list":"0f02f8a5-cb56-4530-a504-f7c590c8b63b","listLevel":1,"spaceAfterPt":8},"id":"bc01e433-8a86-4e3f-af1b-58bf1b84a268","mark":0,"spans":[[14,0]],"text":"A nested point"}},{"paragraph":{"format":{"lineHeight":1.2,"list":"0f02f8a5-cb56-4530-a504-f7c590c8b63b","spaceAfterPt":8},"id":"2a426364-1570-426b-9b6f-40dd458a3a55","mark":0,"spans":[[23,0]],"text":"Back at the first level"}},{"paragraph":{"format":{"lineHeight":1.2,"list":"94228b3d-3f27-465c-801c-61ff2d8ec880","spaceAfterPt":8},"id":"071415da-fbb6-41c8-b8cc-6769fb9038a8","mark":0,"spans":[[17,0]],"text":"Numbered step one"}},{"paragraph":{"format":{"lineHeight":1.2,"list":"94228b3d-3f27-465c-801c-61ff2d8ec880","spaceAfterPt":8},"id":"a71d58d9-8670-4384-96d8-5dba7e0cec8d","mark":0,"spans":[[17,0]],"text":"Numbered step two"}},{"paragraph":{"format":{"lineHeight":1.2,"list":"94228b3d-3f27-465c-801c-61ff2d8ec880",